InterGenOS: record authentication prompt lifecycle boundaries in the
user journal with a fixed message identifier and bounded fields.

The record is emitted only after the modal reports that it opened and at
one terminal boundary. It carries the PolicyKit action identifier, a
process-local sequence, and fixed event and outcome values. Prompt text,
the PolicyKit cookie, identities, credentials, and commands never enter
the structured call.

